  "summary_md": "**Jiajun Fan ([@FanJiajun67938](https://x.com/FanJiajun67938/status/2115309620352758123))** introduces **AudioRSI**, a recursively self-improving audio LLM in which one model is both student and teacher, with the improved student becoming the teacher every T steps. The thread reports MMAU test-mini rising 74.6% → 75.1% (frozen teacher) → 76.1% (AudioRSI) for a 7B model with no external reward model, and a teacher that listens to reject hallucinated reasoning paths.",
  "referenced_urls": [
